id: QUAL-073
ilities: [analysability]
source: cpm
maturity: 4
action: advisory
title: Function with many return statements (>5 — hard to follow flow)
category: quality
severity: info
engine: pattern
target:
  extensions: .ts .js .jsx .tsx .py .java .kt .cs .go
  exclude_paths: test/ tests/ vendor/ node_modules/ .git/ build/ dist/
patterns:
  - regex: ^\s+return\s
    message: "Return statement — 5+ returns in one function makes the control flow hard to follow"
fix: Reduce return points. Use early returns for guards, then a single return for the happy path.
